  "releaseNotes": "Technical changes in 1.1.0: incremented minor version from 1.0.0 to 1.1.0; standardized package IDs/namespaces to Fligoo.Framework.Core.*; upgraded Oracle provider to Oracle.ManagedDataAccess.Core for .NET 10 compatibility; removed legacy packages.config usage in DbContextScope; replaced Microsoft.AspNetCore.App PackageReference with FrameworkReference in Base.Api; updated IdentityModel package pinning (7.1.2); replaced legacy BouncyCastle package with Portable.BouncyCastle for improved Linux compatibility; validated build/runtime with Oracle 19c smoke test.",
